sequenceDiagram
    actor HR
    participant FE as Frontend (React)
    participant BE as Backend (Express)
    participant CS as Cloud Storage (Backblaze B2)
    participant DB as Database (Aiven MySQL via Prisma)

    Note over HR,DB: Phase 1 -- upload + extract (no Candidate rows created yet)
    HR->>FE: Select one or more CV PDF files, upload
    FE->>BE: POST /api/candidates/extract-cv (multipart files)
    loop for each uploaded file
        BE->>BE: Check file.mimetype === application/pdf
        BE->>BE: Check real file bytes start with "%PDF-" (content check, not just declared type)
        alt not a real PDF
            BE->>BE: Add to failed[] list, skip (does not abort the whole batch)
        else is a real PDF
            BE->>CS: saveFile(buffer, randomUUID + ".pdf")
            CS-->>BE: stored
            BE->>BE: extractCvData(buffer) -- best-effort name/email/phone extraction
            BE->>BE: Add {fileId, extractedName, extractedEmail, extractedPhone} to results[]
        end
    end
    BE-->>FE: 200 {files: results[], failed[]}
    FE->>HR: Show extracted fields per file for review/correction

    Note over HR,DB: Phase 2 -- HR confirms reviewed/corrected details
    HR->>FE: Correct name/email/phone if needed, click Confirm
    FE->>BE: POST /api/candidates/confirm-cv-upload {candidates:[{fileId,name,email,phoneNumber}], vacancyId}
    loop for each confirmed entry
        BE->>CS: fileExists(fileId)?
        alt file missing/expired
            BE->>BE: Add to failed[] ("re-upload required")
        else file present
            BE->>DB: findUnique Candidate by email (incl. applications+vacancy)
            alt existing candidate already applied to THIS vacancy
                BE->>BE: Add to matched[] (alreadyOnThisVacancy: true) -- nothing changes
            else existing candidate, different vacancy (or none yet)
                BE->>DB: Update existing Candidate (cvUrl, name, phone)
                BE->>CS: renameFile(fileId, "{candidateId}_{name}.pdf")
                BE->>DB: Update Candidate.cvUrl to final filename
                BE->>DB: writeAuditLog(CV_UPLOADED)
                BE->>BE: Add to matched[] + created[]
            else no existing candidate
                BE->>DB: Create new Candidate row
                BE->>CS: renameFile(fileId, "{candidateId}_{name}.pdf")
                BE->>DB: Update Candidate.cvUrl to final filename
                BE->>BE: Add to created[]
            end
        end
    end
    BE-->>FE: 200 {created[], matched[], failed[]}
    opt matched[] is non-empty
        FE->>HR: Show "Existing candidate found" modal with link to profile
    end
    loop for each entry in created[]
        FE->>BE: POST applyCandidateToVacancy (creates CandidateApplication, stage = APPLIED)
        BE->>DB: Create CandidateApplication + opening ApplicationStageHistory entry
    end
